+---
+type: note
+description: "Why this store is plain markdown files instead of a database."
+---
+# Why files
+
+This store is plain markdown because files are what both humans and
+agents already operate well: readable, diffable, greppable, versioned.
+Anything cleverer — an index, a cache, a graph — is welcome as a
+projection, but never as the truth; see [[topics/derived-state]].
+
+A text-rendered line.
